 ('However, they are home to more than half of all the plant and animal species on land.', 'How much of the world\'s land species live there?', 'More than half', ['About a tenth', 'About a quarter', 'Almost none']),
 ('The Amazon is the largest rainforest, and it spreads across nine countries.', 'How many countries does the Amazon cover? ____', '9', None),
 ('A rainforest has four main layers: the emergent layer, the canopy, the understorey and the forest floor.', 'How many main layers does a rainforest have? ____', '4', None),
 ('Most animals live in the canopy, where there is plenty of light and fruit.', 'Where do most animals live?', 'In the canopy', ['On the forest floor', 'Underground', 'In the rivers']),
 ('Many modern medicines come from rainforest plants, and scientists believe thousands more are still unknown.', 'What do many medicines come from?', 'Rainforest plants', ['Desert minerals', 'Ocean salt', 'Mountain snow']),
